<title>USA: Renaissance holders approve Tribune merger.</title>
<headline>Renaissance holders approve Tribune merger.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Renaissance Communications Corp said on Tuesday that its shareholders approved a $1.13 billion merger with Tribune Co.</p>
<p>Renaissance holders will receive $36 a share in cash, the company said.</p>
<p>The deal, which is subject to Federal Communications Commission approval, is expected to close in early 1997, Renaissance Communications said.</p>
</text>
